<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78094" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρακαθ-ίημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>let down beside</i>, of the nautilus, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντὶ πηδαλίων τῶν πλεκτανῶν παρακαθίησι</span>
			<i>lets down</i> some of its feelers . . , <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				622b14
			</span></i>; <i>let drop</i> or <i>sink by the side</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς χεῖρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Nic.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δακτύλιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.63e
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>send out side-roots</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				8.2.3
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πηδάλια ζεύγλαισι παρακαθίετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					1536
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> intr. (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτόν</span>), <i>sink down</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τοῖς σώμασι διὰ τὸν κόπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					35.1.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
